{"3673730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magic Maho: Dream Runner", "steam_appid": 3673730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/bc90fe889fb2bd4030f8e2795987e89c.avif?t=1760334673\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras_big/bc90fe889fb2bd4030f8e2795987e89c.webp?t=1760334673 width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/78dd2f5f63221ea27c9baf6c7d10c131.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet exciting 2.5D endless runner with a magical girl twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Maho, a high school freshman whisked into a dreamlike world of rooftops, monsters, and one very reliable Pink Sugar Bear. Guided by your fluffy companion, you’ll dash across endless skylines, battle with a sprinkle of magic, and feed sweets to your foes to send them scurrying away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d98d74e2c3c566f91bb90be420cd64cf.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Platforming with a Twist – Easy to pick up, but with surprises as you get more familiar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute &amp; Cinematic – Whimsical visuals and playful monsters bring Maho’s world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Mascot Guide – Pink Sugar Bear isn’t just your guidance, he’s your motivation to go everywhere you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the Monsters! – Toss sweet Pokie sticks to turn danger into delicious score multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Rooftop Adventure – Chill at your own pace or challenge yourself with higher scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d6a1bd962f868faf8105031dd82ccd8f.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, we’re focused on perfecting the endless mode and adding three new monsters to story mode. These are already in active development and will be part of the core experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/11fd0e2d784bcc609f3bf68a498681c7.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our Kickstarter is successful, we’ll expand the dream with even more features — starting with a global leaderboard and additional magical surprises for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/2d78f624b4900181796a5de0b5d222bb.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re a tiny team of two (an artist + a programmer) creating Magic Maho out of love for kawaii anime magic girls and cozy indie games. This demo is just the beginning — with your feedback, we’ll polish and expand the dream until the full game launches in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/bc90fe889fb2bd4030f8e2795987e89c.avif?t=1760334673\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras_big/bc90fe889fb2bd4030f8e2795987e89c.webp?t=1760334673 width=1560 height=244 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/78dd2f5f63221ea27c9baf6c7d10c131.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet exciting 2.5D endless runner with a magical girl twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Maho, a high school freshman whisked into a dreamlike world of rooftops, monsters, and one very reliable Pink Sugar Bear. Guided by your fluffy companion, you’ll dash across endless skylines, battle with a sprinkle of magic, and feed sweets to your foes to send them scurrying away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d98d74e2c3c566f91bb90be420cd64cf.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Platforming with a Twist – Easy to pick up, but with surprises as you get more familiar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute &amp; Cinematic – Whimsical visuals and playful monsters bring Maho’s world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Mascot Guide – Pink Sugar Bear isn’t just your guidance, he’s your motivation to go everywhere you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the Monsters! – Toss sweet Pokie sticks to turn danger into delicious score multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Rooftop Adventure – Chill at your own pace or challenge yourself with higher scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/d6a1bd962f868faf8105031dd82ccd8f.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right now, we’re focused on perfecting the endless mode and adding three new monsters to story mode. These are already in active development and will be part of the core experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/11fd0e2d784bcc609f3bf68a498681c7.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our Kickstarter is successful, we’ll expand the dream with even more features — starting with a global leaderboard and additional magical surprises for players to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/extras/2d78f624b4900181796a5de0b5d222bb.avif?t=1760334673\" width=1560 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re a tiny team of two (an artist + a programmer) creating Magic Maho out of love for kawaii anime magic girls and cozy indie games. This demo is just the beginning — with your feedback, we’ll polish and expand the dream until the full game launches in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Magic Maho: Dream Runner, a cute endless-style runner game about platforming and fighting monsters. Play as Maho, a magical girl stuck in an endless dream where she runs atop rooftops and is chased by monsters. Collect and use her magical staff to feed and defeat the monsters with pokies.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/5577c0cd9e17ab3ac88af7f7d09b8f0aaefbd120/header.jpg?t=1760334673", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/a5e2116db49f1c8e6dbbe2b547053d176b3ba55d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760334673", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673730/a5e2116db49f1c8e6dbbe2b547053d176b3ba55d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760334673", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7 (SP1+) and Windows 10, 64-bit versions only.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  DX10, DX11, and DX12-capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Hardware vendor officially supported drivers</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Nino Studios Inc", "Noah Maestre"], "publishers": ["Nino Studios Inc"], "demos": [{"appid": 3968410, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com